    },
    {
      "id": "note-1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 450,
      "y": 150,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 120,
      "strokeColor": "#666666",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "说明：\n• 用户 Prompt 是整个工作流的起点，包含原始的自然语言请求\n• createAgent 创建核心 agent 实例，为后续中间件注入提供基础框架\n• createSkillsMiddleware 注入技能执行能力，使 agent 能够调用各种工具技能",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10
    },
    {
      "id": "note-2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 450,
      "y": 290,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 120,
      "strokeColor": "#666666",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "说明：\n• createFilesystemMiddleware 添加文件系统访问能力，支持 read_file/write_file/edit_file 等工具调用\n• 模型回复是最终输出阶段，整合所有中间件处理结果，生成结构化的自然语言响应\n• 整个工作流体现了分层架构设计，各中间件可独立替换和扩展",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10
    }
